% improvement**). This is below the plan's 20ms rollback threshold but well above measurement noise (5 runs show ±1.3ms variance). The improvement is real.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1100-batch-mle-interpolation/plan.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1100-batch-mle-interpolation/plan.md:258:1. **MLE Rounds** (`prover.rap_constraints.mle_rounds`): Primary target. Expect 180ms → ~130-150ms at APC 300 (17-28% improvement). This eliminates ~5000 interpolation kernel launches + ~5000 cudaMallocAsync for interpolation buffers + ~5000 columns.to_device() calls, but ~5000 main_ptrs.to_device() calls remain as residual overhead.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1100-batch-mle-interpolation/plan.md:273:- MLE Rounds at APC 300 improves less than 20ms (below noise floor)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1430-batch-mle-main-ptrs-upload/report.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1430-batch-mle-main-ptrs-upload/report.md:61:**The optimization did NOT meet its success criteria.** MLE Rounds at APC 300 improved by only 5ms (170ms → 165ms), well below the plan's 10ms rollback threshold. STARK excl trace showed no net improvement (+4ms, within noise).\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md:363:2. Compare MLE Rounds time at APC 300: 173ms → expect ~155-160ms\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-1630-pingpong-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md:370:- MLE Rounds improvement at APC 300 <10ms\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2300-batch-mle-round-kernels/plan.md:7:**Target**: Reduce MLE Rounds from 182ms to ~80-130ms at APC 300 (save 50-100ms). No regression at APC 0.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2300-batch-mle-round-kernels/plan.md:359:   - MLE Rounds at APC 300: expect 80-130ms (down from ~182ms)\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 20]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JNztHmVdjr4DDDU6TwBd1Y","session_id":"ae9b2456-7a6a-41ad-a41d-1e3f431